{"ref":"BDB, מוּךְ","hw":"מוּךְ","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">מוּךְ</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. be low, depressed, grow poor (</strong>NH <em>id.</em>, Niph.; Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">מוּךְ</span>, <em>sink</em> or <em>bend down;</em> cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, מָכַךְ\" href=\"/BDB,_מָכַךְ\", dir=\"rtl\">מָכַךְ</a>, Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܡܰܟ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܡܟܶܟ</span>, <em>be brought low, humble</em><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. consec. <span dir=\"rtl\">וּמָךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:8\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.8\">Lv 27:8</a> (P); Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָמוּךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.25\">Lv 25:25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:35\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.35\">35</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:39\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.39\">39</a> (all H); Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מָךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:47\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.47\">Lv 25:47</a> (P): all of impoverished Israelites.","next":"BDB, מוּל","prev":"BDB, מוֹטָה"}